From 7705d7994bd4158a94d98337419002541d05c31f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 03:36:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] R22 batch 2: geometry labels from cell records, single
 pair gate, outcome propagation, P11 packaging, independent field

- body record summarises geometry qualification from cell records (false while enclosure ladders are disabled)
- PAIR_GATE_POLICY_R22 V2: one 1e-6 discrete-replay gate; strict prototype gate retired
- pipeline classifies packet outcomes from RESULT.json, fails the batch on scientific stops, captures lane exceptions
- library.package handles a certified plane that adds no macro-cut trace face (P11)
- registered_fields: R18 selection fields plus the R22 independent (2,3,2) field; probes, references and qualification share it
- packet and response PSS budgets raised
